{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-x5-z5-automorphism","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proof","doco:Section"],"label":"prf:x5-z5-automorphism","kind":"proof","title":"Proof of x5 z5 automorphism","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-x5-z5-automorphism"],"text":"x5-z5-automorphism-proof.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prf:x5-z5-automorphism\"></a><p><em>Proof.</em>\nInvariance of the defining equation:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  y^2  =  (\\zeta_5 x)^5 - 1\n      =  \\zeta_5^{\\,5}\\, x^5 - 1\n      =  x^5 - 1,</code></pre>\n<p>using <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_5^{\\,5} = 1</code>.  So <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\phi_5</code> sends points of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{X}_5</code>\nto points of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{X}_5</code>.  Iteration gives\n<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\phi_5^{\\,k}(x, y) = (\\zeta_5^{\\,k} x, y)</code>, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\phi_5^{\\,5} = \\mathrm{id}</code>\nbecause <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_5^{\\,5} = 1</code>.  Order <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5</code>: if <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\phi_5^{\\,k} = \\mathrm{id}</code>\nthen <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_5^{\\,k} x = x</code> for all <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x</code>, forcing <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_5^{\\,k} = 1</code>\nand hence <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5 \\mid k</code>.  <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\square</code></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/brings-surface/x5-z5-automorphism-proof.md","heading":"Proof"}
